{"root":"pli/ms","translators":["sujato"],"title":"The Chapter on Inspiring Qualities","html":"<article class='range' id='an1.378-393'><header><ul><li class='division'><span class='root'>Aṅguttara Nikāya 1 </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>Numbered Discourses 1.378–393 </span></li></ul>\n<h1 class='range-title'><span class='root'>28. Pasādakaradhammavagga </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>The Chapter on Inspiring Qualities </span></h1></header>\n<article id='an1.378'><p data-counter='1'><span class='root'>“Addhamidaṁ, bhikkhave, lābhānaṁ yadidaṁ āraññikattaṁ …pe… </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>“Mendicants, this is definitely something worth having, that is, living in the wilderness … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.379'><p data-counter='2'><span class='root'>piṇḍapātikattaṁ … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>eating only almsfood … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.380'><p data-counter='3'><span class='root'>paṁsukūlikattaṁ … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>wearing rag robes … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.381'><p data-counter='4'><span class='root'>tecīvarikattaṁ … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>having just three robes … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.382'><p data-counter='5'><span class='root'>dhammakathikattaṁ … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>teaching Dhamma … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.383'><p data-counter='6'><span class='root'>vinayadharattaṁ … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>memorizing the monastic law … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.384'><p data-counter='7'><span class='root'>bāhusaccaṁ … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>being very learned … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.385'><p data-counter='8'><span class='root'>thāvareyyaṁ … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>being respected … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.386'><p data-counter='9'><span class='root'>ākappasampadā … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>being well-mannered … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.387'><p data-counter='10'><span class='root'>parivārasampadā … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>having a following … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.388'><p data-counter='11'><span class='root'>mahāparivāratā … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>having a large following … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.389'><p data-counter='12'><span class='root'>kolaputti … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>coming from a good family … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.390'><p data-counter='13'><span class='root'>vaṇṇapokkharatā … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>being handsome … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.391'><p data-counter='14'><span class='root'>kalyāṇavākkaraṇatā … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>being one who enunciates well … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.392'><p data-counter='15'><span class='root'>appicchatā … </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>having few wishes … </span></p></article>\n<article id='an1.393'><p data-counter='16'><span class='root'>appābādhatā”ti. </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'>being healthy.” </span></p></article>\n<p class='endsutta'><span class='root'>(Soḷasa pasādakaradhammā niṭṭhitā.) </span><span class='translation' data-translator='sujato'></span></p></article>"}
